    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "how_to_get_it": "git clone https://github.com/spring-petclinic/spring-petclinic-microservices <dir>  (then: git -C <dir> checkout <commit>); on Windows use a short path and core.longpaths=true. It is only copied and parsed, never built or run."
